@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
title Outbox — chỉ PENDING và SENT
[*] --> PENDING : complete() transaction ghi event
PENDING --> PENDING : defer / attempts+1 / backoff <=60s
PENDING --> SENT : publish confirm + không returned; sent(id)
SENT --> [*]
note bottom of PENDING
Không có FAILED status trong schema.
Broker down: checkout vẫn hoàn tất, event tiếp tục PENDING.
Crash trước mark SENT có thể publish trùng.
end note
@enduml
